  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Hex Spell. For 5...33...40 seconds, whenever this foe is the target of any of your non-hex Mesmer skills, that foe loses 1 Energy and takes 5...21...25 damage per point of Energy lost. If the target foe's Energy drops to 0, Mind Wrack ends and that foe takes 15...83...100 damage.",
      "zhTW": "持續 5～40 秒，每當目標成為你幻術師的非降咒技能之目標時，該敵人失去 1 能量且受到 5～25 傷害。若是目標的能量降至 0 時，心靈破壞終止且造成 15～100 傷害。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Hex Spell. For 5...33...40 seconds, whenever this foe is the target of one of your non-hex Mesmer skills, that foe loses 1 Energy. If the target foe's Energy drops to 0, Mind Wrack ends and that foe takes 15...83...100 damage.",
      "zhTW": "持續 5～40 秒，每當目標成為你幻術師的非降咒技能之目標時，該敵人失去 1 能量且受到 5～25 傷害。若是目標的能量降至 0 時，心靈破壞終止且造成 15～100 傷害。"
    }
